The user is building a **pharmacy management web app** for PHARMACIE TRAMED LTD (Tramed Pharmacy).

Already built: a self-contained `dashboard.html` that shows today's sales KPIs, top products chart, hourly sales chart, payment method split, stock alerts, and transaction log — all from embedded CSV/Excel data.

**Next goal:** Evolve this into a real multi-page web app the user can run and grow over time.

**Why:** The user is also learning web development from scratch as they build this. All work should serve dual purpose — ship useful features AND teach the user how the web works.

**How to apply:** Treat every feature as a learning opportunity. When building something new, briefly explain the concept behind it (e.g., "this is a `<form>` — it collects input from the user"). Keep scope small and iterative.
